yers assemble aggressive, defensive, utility, or hybrid playstyles from run to run. Up to three players can enter together, creating room for cooperation, tension, and shifting priorities around survival and extraction.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/adventurers-gambit-dungeons-of-fortune", "videos": [{"id": 179531, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "fTTZnXG8lvY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fTTZnXG8lvY", "title": "Adventurer's Gambit: Dungeons of Fortune - Trailer (OLD)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fTTZnXG8lvY/fhddefault.jpg"}]}